ernal-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Event Website &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span class="sr-only"&gt; external link&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div&#10; class="strava-embed-placeholder"&#10; data-embed-type="activity"&#10; data-embed-id="14944574240"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;script src="https://strava-embeds.com/embed.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Official brevet result:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div style="margin: 1.5rem 0;"&gt;&#10; &lt;div style="position: relative; padding-top: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 8px;"&gt;&#10; &lt;iframe&#10; name="plotaroute_map_2995755"&#10; src="https://www.plotaroute.com/embedmap/2995755?units=km"&#10; title="Plotaroute map"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;"&#10; allowfullscreen&#10; webkitallowfullscreen&#10; mozallowfullscreen&#10; oallowfullscreen&#10; msallowfullscreen&#10; scrolling="no"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Completion details:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Date: 2025 June 25&lt;br&gt;Distance: 1400 km&lt;br&gt;Elevation: 5627 m&lt;br&gt;Time: 79h55&lt;br&gt;Ride time: 56h 55m&lt;br&gt;Completed in: Lithuania&lt;br&gt;Homologation: 21599&lt;br&gt;Club: LITHUANIA RANDONNEURS&lt;br&gt;Organizer page: &lt;a href="https://www.brevetai.lt/2025-1400" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;brevetai.lt event&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Swiss Alps Gravel Traverse</title><link>https://www.urbontaitis.lt/adventures/2025/swiss-alps-gravel-traverse/</link><pubDate>Fri, 20 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0300</pubDate><guid>https://www.urbontaitis.lt/adventures/2025/swiss-alps-gravel-traverse/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;A high alpine bikepacking adventure across forgotten passes and silent valleys&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This multi-day gravel route takes you across the Swiss Alps, far away from traffic, deep into nature, and high above the valleys. You’ll ride remote pass roads, push your bike on rugged climbs, and sleep under starry skies. Designed for 5–7 days with a tent or lightweight setup.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Route Highlights:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Alte Pragelpassstraße (~1550m) – remote forest gravel&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Klöntal – stunning turquoise lake below vertical cliffs&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Mountain trail above Linthal – panoramic riding with some hike-a-bike (plus: the best soup I ever had in Urnerboden!)&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Klausenpass (1948m) – flowing alpine road, waterfalls and wide views&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Alte Sustenstraße – old gravel route full of character and solitude (my favourite!)&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Sustenpass (2224m) – glaciers and clean mountain air… and a storm arriving 10 minutes after we reached the top. We stayed for a while in the restaurant (btw: cash only!)&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Grimselpass (2165m) – wild and windy, above the deep-blue reservoirs&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;We didn’t expect this view: Grimsel down, Furka up. It was our most emotional moment.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Pastrėviui social bikepacking</title><link>https://www.urbontaitis.lt/adventures/2025/pastreviui-bikepacking/</link><pubDate>Fri, 13 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0300</pubDate><guid>https://www.urbontaitis.lt/adventures/2025/pastreviui-bikepacking/</guid><description>&lt;div&#10; class="strava-embed-placeholder"&#10; data-embed-type="activity"&#10; data-embed-id="14807411994"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;script src="https://strava-embeds.com/embed.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</description></item><item><title>Brevet 400</title><link>https://www.urbontaitis.lt/adventures/2025/brevet-400/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0300</pubDate><guid>https://www.urbontaitis.lt/adventures/2025/brevet-400/</guid><description>&lt;div&#10; class="strava-embed-placeholder"&#10; data-embed-type="activity"&#10; data-embed-id="14720606785"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;script src="https://strava-embeds.com/embed.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Official brevet result:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div style="margin: 1.5rem 0;"&gt;&#10; &lt;div style="position: relative; padding-top: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 8px;"&gt;&#10; &lt;iframe&#10; name="plotaroute_map_2852579"&#10; src="https://www.plotaroute.com/embedmap/2852579?units=km"&#10; title="Plotaroute map"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;"&#10; allowfullscreen&#10; webkitallowfullscreen&#10; mozallowfullscreen&#10; oallowfullscreen&#10; msallowfullscreen&#10; scrolling="no"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Completion details:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Date: 2025 June 6&lt;br&gt;Distance: 400 km&lt;br&gt;Elevation: 2100 m&lt;br&gt;Time: 14h 57m&lt;br&gt;Ride time: 13h 15m&lt;br&gt;Completed in: Lithuania&lt;br&gt;Homologation: 220903&lt;br&gt;Club: LITHUANIA RANDONNEURS&lt;br&gt;Organizer page: &lt;a href="https://www.brevetai.lt/brevetas-2025-400" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;brevetai.lt event&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Nida bikepacking</title><link>https://www.urbontaitis.lt/adventures/2025/nida-bikepacking/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 May 2025 00:00:00 +0300</pubDate><guid>https://www.urbontaitis.lt/adventures/2025/nida-bikepacking/</guid><description>&lt;div&#10; class="strava-embed-placeholder"&#10; data-embed-type="activity"&#10; data-embed-id="14664284143"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;script src="https://strava-embeds.com/embed.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</description></item><item><title>Brevet 300</title><link>https://www.urbontaitis.lt/adventures/2025/brevet-300-2/</link><pubDate>Sat, 24 May 2025 00:00:00 +0300</pubDate><guid>https://www.urbontaitis.lt/adventures/2025/brevet-300-2/</guid><descr