/adventures/2025/brevet-300/</guid><description>&lt;div&#10; class="strava-embed-placeholder"&#10; data-embed-type="activity"&#10; data-embed-id="14158711359"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;script src="https://strava-embeds.com/embed.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</description></item><item><title>Having Fun on Mallorcan Roads</title><link>https://www.urbontaitis.lt/adventures/2025/having-fun-on-mallorcan-roads/</link><pubDate>Thu, 10 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0300</pubDate><guid>https://www.urbontaitis.lt/adventures/2025/having-fun-on-mallorcan-roads/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;In April, my friend and I spent five unforgettable days cycling through the stunning roads of Mallorca. From the coastlines to the mountains, the island offered a perfect mix of scenic views, challenging climbs, and thrilling descents. Whether riding along the crystal-clear waters or through charming villages, we discovered the true beauty of Mallorca one pedal stroke at a time. This collection captures our adventure across the island, showcasing some of the best routes that combine fun, challenge, and breathtaking landscapes.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>